## 1. before the change (HEAD d33cfe3): the gate fails a fresh tarball

$ ./build-package.sh
/mega/tmp/sm750/t18/tree/dist/sm750hdmifb_0.6.0_all.deb
/mega/tmp/sm750/t18/tree/dist/sm750hdmifb-0.6.0-source.tar.gz
/mega/tmp/sm750/t18/tree/dist/SHA256SUMS
# exit: 0

$ ./tests/audit-release.sh
Source archive contains development-only content: docs/plan
# exit: 1

Cause: build-package.sh:98-100 shipped exactly `git ls-files` minus
docs/images, so docs/plan (1 file) and docs/evidence (69 files) travelled in
the archive while tests/audit-release.sh:54-58 forbade both.

